---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | AIO AI" 
  description="AIO AI platform privacy policy. Zero third-party tracker selling, explicit data residency options, and local privacy guarantees."
  hideSidebar={true}
>
  <!-- Public Minimal Header -->
  <header class="border-b border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between sticky top-0 z-30">
    <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
      <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-[#09090B] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs tracking-tight">
        AI
      </div>
      <span class="text-[#09090B] font-black tracking-tight text-base">AIO AI</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/" class="text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-[#09090B] font-medium transition-colors">← Back to Overview</a>
  </header>

  <main class="w-full flex-1 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="border-b border-[#E2E8F0] pb-8 mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold text-[#2563EB] mb-4">
        <span>PRD SECTION 50 COMPLIANCE</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-[#09090B] tracking-tight mb-3">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm font-mono">
        Last updated: October 2026 • Effective Date: October 24, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-sans">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#09090B]">1. Overview & Data Philosophy</h2>
        <p>
          AIO AI ("we", "our", or "platform") operates as an intent-driven discovery and intelligence engine for artificial intelligence tools, production workflows, and open-source models. We operate on a strict data-minimization principle: we collect only the minimal telemetry necessary to calculate community velocity, verify tool uptime, and authenticate user workspace sessions.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or monetize your personal information or search history to third-party data brokers or advertisement networks.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#09090B]">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Authentication Credentials:</strong> When you sign in via Google OAuth or email, we receive your email address, profile avatar, and display name managed via Supabase Auth. Passwords are never stored on our servers in plaintext.</li>
          <li><strong>Workspace & Stack Data:</strong> Tools you bookmark, custom stacks assembled in My Stack Builder, and token calculator presets are saved in our PostgreSQL database to synchronize across your authenticated devices.</li>
          <li><strong>Telemetry & Usage Events:</strong> Anonymous outbound click events, search intent queries, and tool views are logged to compute organic trending velocity and momentum scores.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#09090B]">3. Local-First Processing & Security</h2>
        <p>
          All developer utilities (Image Resizer, JSON Formatter, Context Simulator, Token Cost Calculator) execute 100% locally in your client browser via WebAssembly and HTML5 Canvas. None of your sensitive payloads or API keys uploaded to utilities are transmitted to our remote servers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#09090B]">4. Cookies & Storage</h2>
        <p>
          We utilize browser <code class="bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono">localStorage</code> and session cookies strictly for session authentication persistence and sidebar collapse state. You may clear your local storage at any time through your browser developer settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#09090B]">5. Your Rights & Data Deletion</h2>
        <p>
          Under GDPR, CCPA, and Indian Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDPA), you have the right to request a complete export or immediate permanent purge of all profile data, submitted reviews, and community discussions. Contact our privacy team at <a href="mailto:privacy@aio-ai.dev" class="text-[#2563EB] hover:underline font-bold">privacy@aio-ai.dev</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
